ng a visit to one world trade center  they also made an appearance at global  citizen live to promote covid19 vaccine  equality and while in this country and  many others you can go almost anywhere  and get vaccinated billions of people  around the world cannot of course  harry's relationship with his family  remains strained after he officially  stepped down as senior member of the  royal family earlier this year there is  still some feelings of anger there over  the way in which the couple  sort of carried out their departure from  their royal lives and you know i think  for william that's something that he  clearly hasn't been able to come to  terms with yet  and i think harry as he continues to  thrive in his new life has absolutely no  regrets about the way in which he did it  or the decisions that he made and that  does  create this very big gap between the two  sides  [Music]
 

